  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Vertigo 2",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/22171/450x258/vertigo-2-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1791000000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/22171-buy-vertigo-2-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-254a9bc",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "The BEST VR game i have ever played in my life! I played it for 13 hours and just beat the game. I just can't believe that it's made by one person. And can i not overstate how good this game is. It's my favorite VR game and i played BoneLab, Half-Life Alyx, TW S&S and Into The Radius 2. If you want to buy it this is your sign. This game is really cheap too! In conclusion buy it buy it now!"
    },
    {
      "game": "Resonance: A Plague Tale Legacy",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/19517/450x258/resonance-a-plague-tale-legacy-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1791000000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/19517-buy-resonance-a-plague-tale-legacy-pc-steam/",
      "user": "SpurEisvogel70",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/31391545-1778429197.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Ein wirklich sehr gutes Spiel allerdings absolut nicht das was ich erwartet habe..\n\n\n\nDie Grafik licht etc ist fantastisch, die Story ist gut wenn auch sehr bei den Haaren herbeigezogen. Anfangs viele Rätsel die auch nicht zu schwer waren.. bis das Spiel nach ungefähr 3 h schon fast zu einem horror Spiel wird. Das Kampf System ist zum Glück recht einfach gehalten, die Kämpfe gehören zur Story gehen aber sonst eher auf die Nerven wenn man sich auf die Geschichte einlässt ist man in 9 bis 10 Stunden durch. Leider absolut keinen wieder Spiel wert einmal durchspielen und dann wird's deinstalliert"
    },
    {
      "game": "Wild West Pioneers",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/21950/450x258/wild-west-pioneers-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1791000000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/21950-buy-wild-west-pioneers-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-granny",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "I like the game as a city builder, with supply chains etc. I like the Wild West setting and that there's zero combat (unless you count the money lender, Bill). I played the demo and bought the EA game. However, the unwelcome addition of coarse language into the game really turned me off. Not so much offended as disappointed the devs decided on this. I have made my thoughts known to them. If swearing (including the F word) doesn't bother you then you'll probably enjoy the rest of the game. I have requested and received a refund (as the game also crashed a few times). So caveat emptor."
    },
    {
      "game": "Dragon Age: Inquisition GOTY Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/2291/450x258/dragon-age-inquisition-goty-edition-goty-edition-pc-game-ea-app-cover.jpg?v=1791000000",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/2291-buy-dragon-age-inquisition-goty-edition-goty-edition-pc-game-ea-app/",
      "user": "gamer-307033",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "An absolutely mediocre game. The gameplay becomes tedious and repetitive over time, with numerous pointless side quests designed solely to pad out the playtime. A game based on exploration, where the exploration is probably the most tedious and least rewarding part of the entire game, given the useless treasures scattered across the various maps. Luckily, I bought it on sale for $10; I’m literally forcing myself to finish it so I can then erase it from my memory forever. 5/10"
    }
  ],
